WEBVTT

00:00:25.638 --> 00:00:29.618
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:00:29.642 --> 00:00:33.476
RECORD OF LODOSS WAR
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight

00:02:27.226 --> 00:02:29.923
Orson, forgive me.

00:02:50.683 --> 00:02:54.950
St- Stop it... Stop it... Stop it!

00:02:55.487 --> 00:02:58.650
Stop it! Stop it! STOP IT! STOP IT!

00:03:03.896 --> 00:03:06.365
"Marfa, mother of the earth..."

00:03:06.432 --> 00:03:11.802
"Heal this man's wounds. Return his
body and spirit to what they were."

00:03:28.888 --> 00:03:32.256
Where's Orson?! How's he doing?!

00:03:32.324 --> 00:03:36.386
I think he's going to live.
He's been through a terrible strain.

00:03:36.462 --> 00:03:39.955
His body and spirit are worn out.

00:03:40.032 --> 00:03:41.898
| see...

00:03:41.967 --> 00:03:47.497
That man's soul is possessed
by Hyurii, the spirit of anger.

00:03:47.573 --> 00:03:50.508
It's amazing he's
been able to last this long.

00:03:50.576 --> 00:03:54.012
He's suffering
through a terrible ordeal.

00:03:54.079 --> 00:03:58.175
| wish I had the power to
rid him of the possession.

00:03:58.918 --> 00:04:03.048
I'd prefer not to have anything
to do with a berserker.

00:04:03.122 --> 00:04:05.557
No matter how skilled
a shaman may be...

00:04:05.624 --> 00:04:08.594
...none have ever been able to
drive those spirits away.

00:04:08.661 --> 00:04:12.757
What happens if that
guy goes berserk again?

00:04:12.831 --> 00:04:17.359
Anyway, I'd rather not make an enemy
of someone I can't beat with a sword.

00:04:17.436 --> 00:04:20.133
And as far as enemies
| CAN beat with a sword...

00:04:20.205 --> 00:04:23.368
...I make exceptions for dragons.

00:04:23.642 --> 00:04:26.077
I think it's about time you told us.

00:04:26.145 --> 00:04:29.012
About what it is you heard at
the temple of Marfa, Slayn.

00:04:29.081 --> 00:04:31.846
You're right.
If I don't tell you...

00:04:31.917 --> 00:04:36.878
...you won't understand the
reason we must fight the dragon.

00:04:43.529 --> 00:04:45.827
But first we have
to start by talking about...

00:04:46.098 --> 00:04:50.797
...the destruction of the ancient
Kingdom of Sorcery here in Lodoss.

00:04:50.869 --> 00:04:53.861
Yes. It was 500 years ago...

00:04:54.239 --> 00:04:59.268
The sorcerers of Lodoss brought
glory to the kingdom of Kastuul.

00:05:00.145 --> 00:05:03.115
Using their powers, they
mastered the spirit world...

00:05:03.182 --> 00:05:07.710
...and even made
servants of the dragons.

00:05:08.253 --> 00:05:12.520
However, in their quest to master
ever more powerful forms of magic...

00:05:12.591 --> 00:05:15.720
...a group attempted a grand
magical experiment which failed.

00:05:15.794 --> 00:05:20.231
Their magic was sealed away,
and their holy land was destroyed.

00:05:20.299 --> 00:05:24.236
And waiting for the people after
the destruction of their land...

00:05:24.303 --> 00:05:26.397
...and the loss of their magic...

00:05:26.472 --> 00:05:31.034
...were the barbarian tribes.
It was a bloody uprising.

00:05:33.112 --> 00:05:36.912
How goes the battle,
Governor Saluvan?

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:41.784
Terribly. You and I are
the only nobles...

00:05:41.854 --> 00:05:44.949
...left alive in this city, Karla.

00:05:45.657 --> 00:05:49.059
So, Kastuul has finally fallen
from its position of glory.

00:05:49.762 --> 00:05:52.732
The last ones defending Kuudo are
the dragon's tooth warriors...

00:05:52.798 --> 00:05:55.199
...who aren't even really alive.

00:05:55.267 --> 00:05:59.534
All we did was abuse the barbarians.

00:05:59.605 --> 00:06:02.472
If we'd just manipulated them,
as Marfa taught us...

00:06:02.841 --> 00:06:06.072
You are a believer in Marfa.

00:06:06.378 --> 00:06:09.814
It's because of heretics like
you that we've lost this war.

00:06:10.315 --> 00:06:13.774
Not true. We were destroyed because
we relied on magic so much...

00:06:13.852 --> 00:06:17.811
...that we forgot our
limits as human beings.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.860
You cannot fight destiny.
When we die...

00:06:20.926 --> 00:06:24.089
...this city will only
sink beneath the lake.

00:06:24.163 --> 00:06:27.463
At the very least we'll
take the barbarians with us.

00:06:27.533 --> 00:06:29.592
Still, it's ironic, isn't it?

00:06:29.935 --> 00:06:33.667
The gods were long ago
destroyed by the dragons...

00:06:33.939 --> 00:06:37.898
...and we of the Kingdom of Sorcery,
who have made the five ancient...

00:06:37.976 --> 00:06:41.173
...dragons our servants, have
been destroyed by barbarians.

00:06:41.246 --> 00:06:45.240
Why don't I see the dragons
anywhere around here?

00:06:45.317 --> 00:06:46.807
If we'd used them...

00:06:46.885 --> 00:06:49.547
...we might have postponed the
day of our defeat a bit more.

00:06:49.888 --> 00:06:54.086
They're flying to
various places across Lodoss.

00:06:54.159 --> 00:06:58.118
They've been charged with the duty of
protecting our most precious treasures.

00:06:58.197 --> 00:07:02.156
Someday, the power of Kastuul
will surely be revived.

00:07:02.234 --> 00:07:05.204
For that day, we must
make absolutely sure...

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:08.331
...that the magic of the
Governor's Treasures is not lost.

00:07:08.407 --> 00:07:13.743
A useless struggle... In that case,
I shall live on as I see fit.

00:07:14.079 --> 00:07:19.279
This terrible destruction must
never be allowed to happen again.

00:07:20.052 --> 00:07:23.249
Are you saying that
new circlet you have on...

00:07:23.322 --> 00:07:26.485
...your forehead will be the
means to achieve your plan?

00:07:26.558 --> 00:07:28.993
| pray from the bottom
of my heart...

00:07:29.061 --> 00:07:33.328
...that it doesn't become the last
thing you create as a sorceress.

00:07:35.501 --> 00:07:40.996
After that, Karla fought the
barbarians...and lost her life.

00:07:49.281 --> 00:07:53.650
She then took control of the soul
of the barbarian who killed her...

00:07:53.719 --> 00:07:58.122
...and left behind
the doomed city of Kuudo.

00:08:00.225 --> 00:08:03.195
These are all the memories
I still possess of ...

00:08:03.262 --> 00:08:06.459
...the destruction of the
ancient Kingdom of Sorcery.

00:08:06.532 --> 00:08:12.198
Of most concern in that story is what
the final governor of Kastuul did.

00:08:12.571 --> 00:08:14.505
He entrusted what were known as...

00:08:14.573 --> 00:08:17.099
...the Governor's Treasures to
the five ancient dragons...

00:08:17.176 --> 00:08:21.409
...who then flew to various
points across Lodoss.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.710
I've heard that story before!

00:08:23.782 --> 00:08:26.581
A lot of really
stupid adventurers have...

00:08:26.652 --> 00:08:29.587
...lost their lives
looking for those treasures.

00:08:29.655 --> 00:08:33.592
But suppose that a man appeared
who could kill the dragons...

00:08:33.659 --> 00:08:37.960
...and he claimed the governor's
greatest treasures for himself?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:42.460
If he was a man who had a just
heart, it wouldn't be a problem.

00:08:42.534 --> 00:08:46.129
But if he was evil,
it could be a disaster.

00:08:46.205 --> 00:08:50.438
Wait! Are you saying someone
like that has appeared?!

00:08:50.509 --> 00:08:53.444
A black knight who was after
the treasure guarded by...

00:08:53.512 --> 00:08:58.109
...the ice dragon Bramd
appeared at the temple of Marfa.

00:08:58.183 --> 00:09:01.153
And he seeks the
Scepter of Domination...

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:04.554
...with which he can
control every living thing!

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:10.895
Do you remember
a man named Ashram?

00:09:11.797 --> 00:09:14.129
Did you say..Ashram?!

00:09:21.006 --> 00:09:25.000
How could I forget him?
During the War of Heroes...

00:09:25.077 --> 00:09:28.741
...he was the captain of the royal
guard for Emperor Beld of Marmo.

00:09:28.814 --> 00:09:29.872
Of Marmo?!

00:09:29.948 --> 00:09:32.918
You've gotta be kidding!
If a man like that gets...

00:09:32.985 --> 00:09:36.512
...the Scepter of Domination,
it'd be a disaster!

00:09:36.588 --> 00:09:41.958
That's why we have to get the Scepter
of Domination before he does.

00:09:42.294 --> 00:09:45.025
Even if it means fighting a dragon.

00:09:45.097 --> 00:09:50.365
But wouldn't it be a lot easier to
just kill this Ashram guy instead?

00:09:50.435 --> 00:09:52.529
I'm afraid I can't say yes to that.

00:09:52.604 --> 00:09:58.099
This man was able to kill Bramd in
his lair at White Dragon Mountain.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:01.280
And I'm afraid it's
almost a certainty that...

00:10:01.346 --> 00:10:04.907
...he also managed to kill the
evil dragon Narse on Marmo.

00:10:04.983 --> 00:10:10.649
Which do you think is stronger:
a dragon or a dragon slayer?

00:10:13.292 --> 00:10:17.388
| wouldn't want either one as
an enemy. But we have to do this!

00:10:17.462 --> 00:10:20.432
If another war like the
War of Heroes breaks out...

00:10:20.499 --> 00:10:23.594
...it could turn all
of Lodoss to ashes!

00:10:23.669 --> 00:10:26.639
By the way, have you
considered which dragon...

00:10:26.705 --> 00:10:29.697
...may have the Scepter
of Domination, Slayn?

00:10:29.775 --> 00:10:34.736
Well, since the dragon riders of
Moss don't seem to control...

00:10:34.813 --> 00:10:37.714
...all of Lodoss I think it's safe
to assume that Mycen...

00:10:37.783 --> 00:10:40.718
...the king dragon in Moss,
doesn't have the scepter.

00:10:40.786 --> 00:10:43.187
That leaves only two others.

00:10:43.255 --> 00:10:45.724
Shooting Star
of Fire Dragon Mountain...

00:10:45.791 --> 00:10:48.590
...and Abram, the water dragon
of Blue Dragon Island.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:52.494
These are the two
we'll have to go for.

00:10:52.597 --> 00:10:55.328
You will help us,
won't you, Parn?

00:10:56.835 --> 00:10:58.360
Of course I will!

00:10:58.437 --> 00:11:02.032
In any case, it's vital
that we do not fail.

00:11:02.107 --> 00:11:04.599
We should be very careful
in how we go about this.

00:11:04.676 --> 00:11:06.405
Then how about this, Slayn?

00:11:06.478 --> 00:11:08.879
| was thinking we
should first go to Flaim...

00:11:08.947 --> 00:11:11.882
...and ask King Kashue
for help in this.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:15.614
Actually, I was just thinking
exactly the same thing.

00:11:15.687 --> 00:11:18.657
If we're trying to get
to Fire Dragon Mountain...

00:11:18.724 --> 00:11:21.955
...and Blue Dragon Island,
Flaim is right on the way.

00:11:22.027 --> 00:11:24.394
Besides, I'm sure he'll help us.

00:11:24.463 --> 00:11:28.491
He'll help us out.
The man I know...

00:11:28.567 --> 00:11:32.936
Kashue, the mercenary king of
the desert, surely will!

00:11:45.717 --> 00:11:48.186
At first light,
Parn and his party...

00:11:48.253 --> 00:11:50.312
...made preparations
for their journey...

00:11:50.389 --> 00:11:53.290
...and, with the sun
climbing into the sky...

00:11:53.358 --> 00:11:56.293
...they set out on the path to the
three desert kingdoms of Flaim...

00:11:56.361 --> 00:11:58.955
...leaving Zaxon
village far behind them.

00:12:29.194 --> 00:12:31.492
Shirts! Orson!

00:12:31.563 --> 00:12:34.464
Just going off like
that is cruel, Parn!

00:12:34.533 --> 00:12:38.731
I still haven't paid you
back for saving my life!

00:12:39.137 --> 00:12:41.629
You want to do me a favor?

00:12:41.706 --> 00:12:45.904
Look, I appreciate the thought,
but this really isn't the time.

00:12:45.977 --> 00:12:48.241
|I understand that, but that's okay.

00:12:48.313 --> 00:12:53.513
Because I've decided to come with you
guys and help you kill that dragon!

00:12:54.653 --> 00:12:56.212
You what?!

00:12:56.555 --> 00:12:59.490
Despite appearances,
I'm a pretty damned good fighter.

00:12:59.558 --> 00:13:02.493
I can be of use to you,
so let me come! Parn!

00:13:02.561 --> 00:13:03.722
But...

00:13:03.795 --> 00:13:07.993
I'm against it! Taking some girl who
just rode in from God knows where...

00:13:08.066 --> 00:13:12.435
First of all, she's a
mercenary hired by Duke Raster!

00:13:12.838 --> 00:13:15.569
Naturally, my contract
with him is now broken.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:18.610
Besides, is it really such a
good idea for the captain of...

00:13:18.677 --> 00:13:21.476
...the self-defense force to
leave the village and go traveling?

00:13:21.546 --> 00:13:23.981
While I'm away, the village will
be protected by holy soldiers...

00:13:24.049 --> 00:13:26.416
...of the temple of Marfa as well
as the dwarf clan to the north!

00:13:26.485 --> 00:13:30.718
Mind your own damned business!
And I'm still against her coming!

00:13:30.789 --> 00:13:34.748
Unfortunately, nobody asked you!
Now shut up, greenhorn!

00:13:34.826 --> 00:13:36.191
What did you call me...?!

00:13:36.261 --> 00:13:38.855
Okay, cut it out right now!

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:42.195
If you're going to pick fights,
you don't have to come!

00:13:42.801 --> 00:13:45.736
Meaning I can come as long as
I don't pick a fight, right?

00:13:45.804 --> 00:13:48.364
Well, I guess...

00:13:49.674 --> 00:13:53.872
Her actions since yesterday
lead me to trust her word.

00:13:53.945 --> 00:13:57.813
Besides, you can't have too many
friends in an endeavor like this, right?

00:13:57.883 --> 00:13:59.282
Master Slayn!

00:13:59.351 --> 00:14:00.750
Deed?

00:14:00.819 --> 00:14:04.278
| think...
If you say it's all right, Parn.

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:09.127
All right, just don't do anything
rash. This is really dangerous.

00:14:09.194 --> 00:14:11.390
All right! I knew you'd agree!

00:14:11.463 --> 00:14:16.025
Don't worry! Facing a strong enemy
just encourages me to fight harder!

00:14:16.101 --> 00:14:17.193
Hey!

00:14:22.607 --> 00:14:25.633
| understand you healed me.
Thank you.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.371
It was nothing.

00:14:27.445 --> 00:14:31.006
Hold it! The berserker's
coming with us, too?!

00:14:31.082 --> 00:14:37.146
Orson's my partner. We've been
together for years, and I'm fine.

00:14:37.722 --> 00:14:39.383
But...

00:14:39.457 --> 00:14:40.549
Deed...

00:14:41.459 --> 00:14:46.625
If I said that he was MY friend,
would you agree to his coming?

00:14:54.773 --> 00:14:58.471
Do you remember what Leylia
told us about last night?

00:14:58.543 --> 00:15:02.707
The truth is that there's another
vital point to that story.

00:15:02.781 --> 00:15:04.408
A vital point?

00:15:04.482 --> 00:15:09.318
The last sorceress of the Kingdom of
Sorcery, Karla, is still alive.

00:15:09.387 --> 00:15:11.719
It's one of my old friends.

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:15.021
She's taken the appearance
of a man named Woodchuck.

00:15:16.161 --> 00:15:18.095
Karla's power and
personality are sealed in...

00:15:18.163 --> 00:15:20.689
...a circlet she
wears on her forehead.

00:15:20.765 --> 00:15:24.030
Whoever wears it has their
soul taken over by her.

00:15:24.102 --> 00:15:27.037
By constantly exchanging
bodies with others...

00:15:27.105 --> 00:15:30.405
...she's been able to
achieve immortality.

00:15:31.409 --> 00:15:33.343
And it was her, the Grey Witch...

00:15:33.411 --> 00:15:37.370
...who's been responsible for
all the war and chaos in Lodoss!

00:15:37.449 --> 00:15:40.248
She causes it? For what reason?

00:15:40.318 --> 00:15:42.685
Since it was destroyed by
its pursuit of great power...

00:15:42.754 --> 00:15:46.281
...she doesn't want the tragedy of the
Kingdom of Sorcery to be repeated.

00:15:46.358 --> 00:15:50.317
Karla believes that her shifting
the power between kingdoms...

00:15:50.395 --> 00:15:53.660
...will ensure eternal
prosperity for Lodoss.

00:15:54.633 --> 00:15:58.433
Then, the War of
Heroes five years ago...!

00:15:58.503 --> 00:16:03.100
And the body Karla's circlet
controlled back then was...

00:16:06.077 --> 00:16:07.977
No... You mean...?!

00:16:08.046 --> 00:16:11.016
She's desperate to atone
for the chaos she caused...

00:16:11.082 --> 00:16:14.450
...while her body was
under Karla's control.

00:16:14.519 --> 00:16:18.183
Even to the point of going on a
dangerous journey to stop a war.

00:16:18.256 --> 00:16:22.989
Or like saving a warrior whose heart
is controlled by the spirit of anger.

00:16:23.061 --> 00:16:27.430
You may have said too much,
Sir Free Knight. Besides, look.

00:16:45.483 --> 00:16:50.114
Come, we must hurry onward.
We must cross the mountains...

00:16:50.188 --> 00:16:52.520
...and get to Flaim
as fast as we can.

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:54.581
You're right.

00:16:54.659 --> 00:16:56.627
To protect the land of Lodoss...

00:16:56.695 --> 00:16:59.630
...I have to get to King
Kashue as fast as I can!

00:17:00.832 --> 00:17:04.029
At that moment, in the
temple of the war god Myrii...

00:17:04.102 --> 00:17:09.666
...just outside of Blade, the capital
of the desert kingdom of Flaim...

00:17:09.774 --> 00:17:12.709
...the priest Hobb is visited
by a company of knights...

00:17:12.777 --> 00:17:16.577
...unfamiliar in this area,
all clad in thick, black armor.

00:17:22.187 --> 00:17:25.418
I'll ask you one more time!
You honestly expect me...

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:28.619
...to abandon this post
King Kashue has given to me...

00:17:29.327 --> 00:17:33.093
...all so I can help
you knights of Marmo?!

00:17:33.865 --> 00:17:37.301
I'd heard that there was no greater
honor for a priest of the war god...

00:17:37.368 --> 00:17:40.770
...than to teach brave knights
how to become more powerful.

00:17:40.839 --> 00:17:43.968
I need your power, Priest.

00:17:44.409 --> 00:17:49.142
You consider yourself a hero
on the same level as King Kashue?

00:17:50.348 --> 00:17:52.476
That's exactly what I think.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:56.248
Ridiculous! King Kashue is a true
hero from the War of Heroes...

00:17:56.321 --> 00:17:59.951
...where he helped to
kill Emperor Beld of Marmo!

00:18:01.426 --> 00:18:05.260
And so he worries
only about his own kingdom...

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:08.595
...not even looking at the condition
of those outside of it.

00:18:08.666 --> 00:18:10.498
Are those the actions
of a "true hero"?

00:18:12.537 --> 00:18:14.801
The result of that war was
the destruction of Marmo.

00:18:14.873 --> 00:18:16.773
That cannot be denied.

00:18:16.841 --> 00:18:23.338
However, we share the great dream
Emperor Beld had of uniting Lodoss!

00:18:24.415 --> 00:18:28.648
Kashue, a man content to rule only
Flaim, isn't nearly the man Beld was!

00:18:30.021 --> 00:18:34.458
Just which man deserves
the title of "true hero"?!

00:18:34.626 --> 00:18:37.220
A priest of Myrii, one of the
so-called "Seekers of Heroes"...

00:18:37.295 --> 00:18:39.263
...should know
the answer to that.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:44.860
But, with Emperor Beld dead now,
there's no way anyone can prove that!

00:18:45.136 --> 00:18:51.667
A simple matter. I'll just conquer
Kashue and become king of all Lodoss.

00:18:51.743 --> 00:18:55.270
I shall be the one to
fulfill Emperor Beld's dreams!

00:18:55.346 --> 00:18:58.805
For I hold in my hand the thing
which makes me worthy of such glory!

00:19:11.963 --> 00:19:16.196
You will see this
yourself later on.

00:19:26.878 --> 00:19:30.178
Four days later, Parn and
his party arrived in Flaim...

00:19:30.248 --> 00:19:36.585
...and the priest Hobb vanished
from the temple of Myrii.

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:43.852
Welcome...

00:19:43.928 --> 00:19:45.487
...to Lodoss Island!

00:19:45.563 --> 00:19:46.962
And now, what you've
all been waiting for...

00:19:47.031 --> 00:19:48.726
...the second part of the show!

00:19:52.804 --> 00:19:56.172
Hi-i-i-it My name's Deedlit!

00:19:56.808 --> 00:20:01.075
I'm a high elf who loves nature,
is friends with spirits...

00:20:03.248 --> 00:20:06.707
...and I'm just the absolute
CUTEST girl you can imagine!

00:20:06.784 --> 00:20:09.651
Should you really go that
far in your own description?

00:20:09.721 --> 00:20:12.656
My best points are
my lovely, long ears...

00:20:12.724 --> 00:20:15.659
My bust, waist, and
hip measurements, and...

00:20:15.727 --> 00:20:19.789
As for my age, that's
my little secret!

00:20:20.765 --> 00:20:22.733
What's with her?
Just 'cuz she's a high elf...

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:25.167
...she acts like she's a
princess or something!

00:20:25.236 --> 00:20:26.465
Oh, Deed...

00:20:26.537 --> 00:20:29.336
What does Parn see in
an older woman like her?

00:20:29.407 --> 00:20:31.307
What's the problem?

00:20:31.376 --> 00:20:34.004
It's fashionable to
have an older girlfriend.

00:20:34.078 --> 00:20:35.068
She's older than me?

00:20:35.146 --> 00:20:37.171
Didn't you know?

00:20:37.348 --> 00:20:40.215
Elves may look young...

00:20:40.285 --> 00:20:43.311
...but they age differently than
humans do. She's actually...

00:20:43.388 --> 00:20:44.480
WHAT?!

00:20:46.391 --> 00:20:49.292
A hundred and
sixty years old?!

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:50.521
That is WHY I SAID...

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:54.092
...my age is a SECRET"!

00:20:54.165 --> 00:20:57.362
Anyway, using my specialty,
shamanistic magic...

00:20:57.435 --> 00:21:00.234
...I'll defend Parn!

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:11.110
Wow! Wow!

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:14.181
And, of course...

00:21:14.485 --> 00:21:17.944
Ta-daa! Just kidding!

00:21:20.725 --> 00:21:23.786
Shamanist magic is just amazing!

00:21:24.262 --> 00:21:26.754
All right, then,
I'll keep trying my best!

00:21:30.068 --> 00:21:33.333
Are you sure we should be
traveling with this guy?

00:21:33.404 --> 00:21:36.533
That's another thing
you should never bring up...

00:22:59.490 --> 00:23:01.891
Now reunited with
our old comrade, King Kashue...

00:23:02.126 --> 00:23:06.256
...we decide to take on Shooting Star,
the fire dragon, together!

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:09.095
At a glittering party
which presages our showdown...

00:23:09.167 --> 00:23:13.070
...the king offers me
an unexpected proposal.

00:23:13.137 --> 00:23:16.539
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:16.607 --> 00:23:18.405
"King... The Long Sought Hero".
